  DialogueSnippets:
  - SpeakerName: Mina
    HasSpeakerSprite: 1
    SpeakerSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 080caa0edd7536d448df7e9c059c8f9a, type: 3}
    HasBackgroundSprite: 0
    BackgroundSprite: {fileID: 0}
    Text: I remember that story, wasn't this about the girl who can fly, but she
      keeps forgetting where her home is?
  - SpeakerName: Young Mina
    HasSpeakerSprite: 1
    SpeakerSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 19cb878ae217df648ba82e0116391c43, type: 3}
    HasBackgroundSprite: 0
    BackgroundSprite: {fileID: 0}
    Text: Yeah, how does it end tho? I was thinking of adding bunnies to her home
      and adding a twist like she was a bunny monster the whole time.
  - SpeakerName: Mina
    HasSpeakerSprite: 1
    SpeakerSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 080caa0edd7536d448df7e9c059c8f9a, type: 3}
    HasBackgroundSprite: 0
    BackgroundSprite: {fileID: 0}
    Text: I didn't finish it, I haven't bothered.
  - SpeakerName: Young Mina
    HasSpeakerSprite: 1
    SpeakerSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 19cb878ae217df648ba82e0116391c43, type: 3}
    HasBackgroundSprite: 0
    BackgroundSprite: {fileID: 0}
    Text: Why didn't you finish it tho? I am hooked on the story. I hope the poor
      girl finds her way.
  - SpeakerName: Mina
    HasSpeakerSprite: 1
    SpeakerSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 080caa0edd7536d448df7e9c059c8f9a, type: 3}
    HasBackgroundSprite: 0
    BackgroundSprite: {fileID: 0}
    Text: I dont rember why.
